    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "World's Largest Airplane Hangar at Pan American Terminal.\nMiami, Florida\n18",
      "The world's largest aircraft, 40 passenger 17 ton\nClipper Flying boats, wider than a pullman car, leave at\nfrequent intervals, carrying mail and passengers to Havana.\nThe Pan American Airways\nJamaica and South America; Aerial Gateway between the\nTerminal at Miami is the\nAmericas.\nTICHNOR QUALITY VIEWS\" REG U.S. PAT,OFF. MADE ONLY BY TICHNOR BROS. INC. BOSTON. MASS\n65120\nPLACE\nONE CENT\nSTAMP\nHERE\nMADE IN US. A\nARD"
